                "description": "The 18 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Pull is available in 6 different, modern finishes including antique and satin brass. This contemporary cabinet door pull is made by Omnia who is well-known for high-quality and high-style. This isn't some cheap cabinet door pull you'll find at one of the depots; the Modern Rectangular 18 Inch Cabinet Handle is both sophisticated and timeless.",
